          "bodySize": 11969,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 11969,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 9]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 9]><!-->\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<!--[if !IE]><!--><script>if(document.documentMode) document.documentElement.className+=' ie'+document.documentMode;</script><!--<![endif]-->\n\n<head>\n\n            <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n          })\n                              (window, document, 'script', 'dataLayer', 'GTM-W5VLL9M');\n                  </script>\n    \n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\">\n<title>Cottontail + Director Q&A\r\n | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"We are delighted to welcome director (and Hammersmith local) Patrick \r\n      Dickinson to our cinema for a post-show Q&amp;A after this special screening.\r\n    \r\n    \r\n      \r\n    \r\n    \r\n      From Tokyo to the Lake District - a universal portrait of lov\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Cottontail + Director Q&A\r\n | Riverside Studios\">\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Cottontail + Director Q&A\",\"description\":\"We are delighted to welcome director (and Hammersmith local) Patrick \\r\\n      Dickinson to our cinema for a post-show Q&amp;A after this special screening.\\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      \\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      From Tokyo to the Lake District - a universal portrait of love, \\r\\n      acceptance and family loss in which the true journey toward forgiveness \\r\\n      and reconciliation will prove the hardest of all.\\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n       \\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      After the death of his wife, Kenzaburo and their son Toshi receive an \\r\\n      unexpected letter from beyond the grave. Kenzaburo's wife and Toshi's \\r\\n      mother, Akiko, asks them to scatter her ashes at the place she loved \\r\\n      most as a child &#8211; Lake Windermere. But the father's and son&#8217;s fraught \\r\\n      relationship threatens to upend their journey.\\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n       \\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      Starring Hirokazu Kore-eda regular, Lily Franky (Shoplifters, After the \\r\\n      Storm, Like Father, Like Son) and with a supporting role from Ciar&#225;n \\r\\n      Hinds (Belfast, Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows Part 2).\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/25320486e7760103c108a9a0ecc04e2c.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-03-05T17:50:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-05T17:50:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon.ico?1651755466\" />\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/cottontail-director-qa-163455/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//code.jquery.com/ui/1.12.1/themes/base/jquery-ui.css\">\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.css\" /> -->\n\n<link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/css/styles.min.css?v=b660f5e1efcf1b00290891e9f653159e\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<script>\n  document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/, 'js');\n  var base_url = 'https://riversidestudios.co.uk/',\n    gdrck = '6LffRNoZAAAAAJIWWC7QG27lobOmUg6S4sE9GI8k',\n  gdmaps = {},\n    $ajaxRequestSent = false;\n</script>\n\n    <script>\n      var gdEvents = false;\n    </script>\n    \n\n            <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Cottontail + Director Q&A - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/cottontail-director-qa-163455/\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/25320486e7760103c108a9a0ecc04e2c.jpg\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We are delighted to welcome director (and Hammersmith local) Patrick \r\n      Dickinson to our cinema for a post-show Q&amp;A after this special screening.\r\n    \r\n    \r\n      \r\n    \r\n    \r\n      From Tokyo to the Lake District - a universal portrait of lov\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"EN_GB\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n 