            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 10920,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 9]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 9]><!-->\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<!--[if !IE]><!--><script>if(document.documentMode) document.documentElement.className+=' ie'+document.documentMode;</script><!--<![endif]-->\n\n<head>\n\n            <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n          })\n                              (window, document, 'script', 'dataLayer', 'GTM-W5VLL9M');\n                  </script>\n    \n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\">\n<title>National Theatre Live: The Importance Of Being Earnest\r\n | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Three-time Olivier Award-winner Sharon D Clarke is joined by Ncuti Gatwa \r\n      (Doctor Who; Sex Education) in this joyful reimagining of Oscar Wilde&#8217;s \r\n      most celebrated comedy.\r\n    \r\n    \r\n      \r\n    \r\n    \r\n      While assuming the role o\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"National Theatre Live: The Importance Of Being Earnest\r\n | Riverside Studios\">\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: The Importance Of Being Earnest\",\"description\":\"Three-time Olivier Award-winner Sharon D Clarke is joined by Ncuti Gatwa \\r\\n      (Doctor Who; Sex Education) in this joyful reimagining of Oscar Wilde&#8217;s \\r\\n      most celebrated comedy.\\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      \\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      While assuming the role of a dutiful guardian in the country, Jack lets \\r\\n      loose in town under a false identity. Meanwhile, his friend Algy adopts \\r\\n      a similar facade. Hoping to impress two eligible ladies, the gentlemen \\r\\n      find themselves caught in a web of lies they must carefully navigate.\\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      \\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      Max Webster (Life of Pi) directs this hilarious story of identity, \\r\\n      impersonation and romance, filmed live from the National Theatre in \\r\\n      London.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/2406f7e73b2d5d29074ccb95cada61ae.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-03-06T19:45:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-06T19:45:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon.ico?1651755466\" />\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/national-theatre-live-the-importance-of-being-earnest/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//code.jquery.com/ui/1.12.1/themes/base/jquery-ui.css\">\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/c