            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 12782,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 9]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 9]><!-->\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<!--[if !IE]><!--><script>if(document.documentMode) document.documentElement.className+=' ie'+document.documentMode;</script><!--<![endif]-->\n\n<head>\n\n            <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n          })\n                              (window, document, 'script', 'dataLayer', 'GTM-W5VLL9M');\n                  </script>\n    \n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\">\n<title>The Last Showgirl\r\n | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Golden Globe Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best Actress in a Drama RoleScreen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best ActressScreen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Supporting ActressBAFTA Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Suppor\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"The Last Showgirl\r\n | Riverside Studios\">\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"The Last Showgirl\",\"description\":\"Golden Globe Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best Actress in a Drama RoleScreen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best ActressScreen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Supporting ActressBAFTA Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Supporting Actress\\\"Pamela Anderson is dazzling\\\" The New York TimesDirected by Gia Coppola, The Last Showgirl sees Pamela Anderson mounting an extraordinary comeback performance as Shelly, a Las Vegas dancer who is left adrift after the revue show she has been performing in for 30 years suddenly closes. Pamela's performance has been hugely acclaimed by critics and she has featured as a major contender in the awards race this year, having already landed Best Actress nominations at the Golden Globes and the Screen Actors Guild awards. She is surrounded by an equally excellent supporting cast, including Jamie Lee Curtis (nominated for both the BAFTA and SAG Award for Best Supporting Actress), Kiernan Shipka, Brenda Song, Billie Lourd and Dave Bautista.\\\"The role of a lifetime for Pamela Anderson\\\" IndieWire\\\"An award-worthy performance...raw and beautiful\\\" Entertainment Weekly\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/757970c78b4690b2888b299192453814.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-03-07T17:40:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-13T20:35:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon.ico?1651755466\" />\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/the-last-showgirl-161781/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//code.jquery.com/ui/1.12.1/themes/base/jquery-ui.css\">\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.css\" /> -->\n\n<link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/css/styles.min.css?v=b660f5e1efcf1b00290891e9f653159e\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<script>\n  document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/, 'js');\n  var base_url = 'https://riversidestudios.co.uk/',\n    gdrck = '6LffRNoZAAAAAJIWWC7QG27lobOmUg6S4sE9GI8k',\n  gdmaps = {},\n    $ajaxRequestSent = false;\n</script>\n\n    <script>\n      var gdEvents = false;\n    </script>\n    \n\n            <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Last Showgirl - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/the-last-showgirl-161781/\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/757970c78b4690b2888b299192453814.jpg\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Golden Globe Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best Actress in a Drama RoleScreen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best ActressScreen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Supporting ActressBAFTA Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Suppor\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"EN_GB\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n        