r\n                        <div class=\"booking-section-field performance-times\"></div>\r\n\r\n                      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                      <!-- <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Select a date and time to book time</div> -->\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"booking-section ticket-section-seats\" data-section=\"2\">\r\n                  <div class=\"container mobile-only-break-768\">\r\n                    <div class=\"booking-section-content\">\r\n\r\n                      <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Select your seats</div>\r\n                      <button class=\"button button-blue go-to-basket\" data-action=\"5\" disabled>Next: Checkout</button>\r\n\r\n                      <div class=\"booking-section-field\">\r\n                        <div id=\"priceBands\">\r\n                          <div class=\"price-band\" data-band=\"5\"><span class=\"icon\" style=\"background: #000000\"></span><span class=\"title\">Sold &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"selectedArea\">\r\n                          <div class=\"zoom-label\">Viewing: <span class=\"zoomed-area\"></span></div>\r\n                          <div class=\"reset-zoom\">Reset</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"seatSelector\" style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 70%; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; \">\r\n                          <svg style=\"position: absolute; left:0; top:0; width:100%; height:100%\" id=\"seatingPlan\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"screen\">STAGE</div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"selectedSeats\">\r\n                          <div class=\"selected-seat-title font-title font-uppercase font-blue font-small\">Selected Seats</div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                                <!-- <div class=\"booking-section\" data-section=\"5\">\r\n                  <div class=\"container mobile-only-break-768\">\r\n                    <div class=\"booking-section-content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Checkout</div>\r\n\r\n                      <button class=\"button button-blue booking-next-step t\" data-action=\"6\">Checkout</button>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div> -->\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"template-bottom-inner\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-mobile\">\r\n\r\n\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"template-left\">\r\n\r\n                                      <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><strong>Golden Globe Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best Actress in a Drama Role</strong></p><p><strong>Screen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Pamela Anderson, Best Actress</strong></p><p><strong>Screen Actors Guild Award Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Supporting Actress</strong></p><p><strong>BAFTA Nominee - Jamie Lee Curtis, Best Supporting Actress</strong></p><blockquote><p><i>\"Pamela Anderson is dazzling\" The New York Times</i></p></blockquote><p>Directed by Gia Coppola, <i><strong>The Last Showgirl </strong></i>sees Pamela Anderson mounting an extraordinary comeback performance as Shelly, a Las Vegas dancer who is left adrift after the revue show she has been performing in for 30 years suddenly closes. Pamela's performance has been hugely acclaimed by critics and she has featured as a major contender in the awards race this year, having already landed <strong>Best Actress </strong>nominations at the <strong>Golden Globes</strong> and the <strong>Screen Actors Guild</strong> awards. She is surrounded by an equally excellent supporting cast, including Jamie Lee Curtis (nominated for both the <strong>BAFTA </strong>and <strong>SAG Award for Best Supporting Actress</strong>), Kiernan Shipka, Brenda Song, Billie Lourd and Dave Bautista.</p><p><i>\"The role of a lifetime for Pamela Anderson\" IndieWire</i></p><p><i>\"An award-worthy performance...raw and beautiful\" Entertainment Weekly</i></p></div>            \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"template-right\">\r\n              \r\n                        <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Rating Information: </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\"><span>strong language, sex references</span></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n                                          <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Run time:</div>\r\n                <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>88 mins</span></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Year of release:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>2025</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Company:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>Picturehouse</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Director:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>Gia Coppola</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Cast:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>Pamela Anderson, Brenda Song, Kiernan Shipka</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n              \r\n              <div class=\"performance_details\">\r\n                <div class=\"performance-label\">Select a time to book</div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Friday 7 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"PlRZK4HB||1111:15670\">17:40</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Saturday 8 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"KfIEfUxj||1111:15668\">15:40</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"KfIEfUxj||1111:15671\">18:20</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Sunday 9 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"O2e6digp||1111:15672\">15:40</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Monday 10 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"uDSV2Nbk||1111:15673\">20:35</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Tuesday 11 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"8drCuGse||1111:15669\">18:00</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"more-performances\">\r\n                <button class=\"button button-pink book-now-button\">See more dates and times</button>\r\n              </div>\r\n        