            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 9]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 9]><!-->\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<!--[if !IE]><!--><script>if(document.documentMode) document.documentElement.className+=' ie'+document.documentMode;</script><!--<![endif]-->\n\n<head>\n\n            <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n          })\n                              (window, document, 'script', 'dataLayer', 'GTM-W5VLL9M');\n                  </script>\n    \n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\">\n<title>Doctor Who: Tomb of the Cybermen Episode Showcase + Q&A\r\n | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Riverside Studios are delighted to bring to you our next DOCTOR WHO episode showcase! Riverside was crucial to the early filming of DOCTOR WHO in its 'classic era', and this celebratory showcase focuses on another of the Doctor's inimitable enemies - The \">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Doctor Who: Tomb of the Cybermen Episode Showcase + Q&A\r\n | Riverside Studios\">\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Doctor Who: Tomb of the Cybermen Episode Showcase + Q&A\",\"description\":\"Riverside Studios are delighted to bring to you our next DOCTOR WHO episode showcase! Riverside was crucial to the early filming of DOCTOR WHO in its 'classic era', and this celebratory showcase focuses on another of the Doctor's inimitable enemies - The Cybermen - with a complete second Doctor (Patrick Troughton) serial being shown: TOMB OF THE CYBERMEN.&nbsp;Doctor Who writers and episode lineup curators Gavin Rymill and James Goss will introduce each Cyber episode, providing a brief watcher's guide, then offer up a quick \\\"post-show post-mortem\\\" before introducing the next episode, with a final Q&amp;A after the last episode in the showcase.&nbsp;EPISODE LINEUPThe Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 1 - 1967-09-02The Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 2 - 1967-09-09The Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 3 - 1967-09-16The Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 4 - 1967-09-23&nbsp;Gavin Rymill is a writer, researcher and digital creator who has worked on the Doctor Who range for nearly 20 years. He sculpted 70 monsters for the figurine collection, illustrated the TARDIS and Dalek manuals and built sets and props for The Evil of the Daleks animation. In his spare time he reconstructs missing episodes and counts the screws on Daleks with Jon Green. His favourite flavour of Dalek is Exxilon.&nbsp;James Goss has written a number of Doctor Who books, produces audio dramas. He once wrote a collection of Doctor Who poetry with Russell T Davies and wrote a book with Tom Baker. His most treasured possession is a copy of The Dalek Book from 1965.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/ec411c5667475a490b474e9e99d4cbd9.png\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-03-08T13:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-08T13:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon.ico?1651755466\" />\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/doctor-who-tomb-of-the-cybermen-episode-showcase-qa-157191/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//code.jquery.com/ui/1.12.1/themes/base/jquery-ui.css\">\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.css\" /> -->\n\n<link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/css/styles.min.css?v=b660f5e1efcf1b00290891e9f653159e\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<script>\n  document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/, 'js');\n  var base_url = 'https://riversidestudios.co.uk/',\n    gdrck = '6LffRNoZAAAAAJIWWC7QG27lobOmUg6S4sE9GI8k',\n  gdmaps = {},\n    $ajaxRequestSent = false;\n</script>\n\n    <script>\n      var gdEvents = false;\n    </script>\n    \n\n            <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Doctor Who: Tomb of the Cybermen Episode Showcase + Q&A - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/doctor-who-tomb-of-the-cybermen-episode-showcase-qa-157191/\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/ec411c5667475a490b474e9e99d4cbd9.png\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Riverside Studios are delighted to bring to you our next DOCTOR WHO episode showcase! Riverside was crucial to the early filming of DOCTOR WHO in its 'classic era', and this celebratory showcase focuses on another of the Doctor's inimitable enemies - The \"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"EN_GB\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Doctor Who: Tomb of the Cybermen Episode Showcase + Q&A - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Riverside Studios are delighted to bring to you our next DOCTOR WHO episode showcase! Riverside was crucial to the early filming of DOCTOR WHO in its 'classic era', and this celebratory showcase focuses on another of the Doctor's inimitable enemies - The \"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:image:src\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/ec411c5667475a490b474e9e99d4cbd9.png\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:domain\" content=\"riversidestudios.co.uk\"/>\n            \n\n\n\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon-32x32.png\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon-16x16.png\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/site.webmanifest\">\n<link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk