</div>\r\n                      <button class=\"button button-blue booking-next-step \" disabled data-action=\"2\">Next: Select ticket</button>\r\n\r\n                      <div class=\"booking-section-content-left\">\r\n                        <div class=\"booking-section-content-label\">Select Date</div>\r\n                        <div class=\"booking-section-field event-datepicker\"></div>\r\n\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"booking-section-content-right\">\r\n                        <div class=\"booking-section-content-label\">Select Time</div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"booking-section-field performance-times\"></div>\r\n\r\n                      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                      <!-- <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Select a date and time to book time</div> -->\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"booking-section ticket-section-seats\" data-section=\"2\">\r\n                  <div class=\"container mobile-only-break-768\">\r\n                    <div class=\"booking-section-content\">\r\n\r\n                      <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Select your seats</div>\r\n                      <button class=\"button button-blue go-to-basket\" data-action=\"5\" disabled>Next: Checkout</button>\r\n\r\n                      <div class=\"booking-section-field\">\r\n                        <div id=\"priceBands\">\r\n                          <div class=\"price-band\" data-band=\"5\"><span class=\"icon\" style=\"background: #000000\"></span><span class=\"title\">Sold &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"selectedArea\">\r\n                          <div class=\"zoom-label\">Viewing: <span class=\"zoomed-area\"></span></div>\r\n                          <div class=\"reset-zoom\">Reset</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"seatSelector\" style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 70%; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; \">\r\n                          <svg style=\"position: absolute; left:0; top:0; width:100%; height:100%\" id=\"seatingPlan\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"screen\">STAGE</div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"selectedSeats\">\r\n                          <div class=\"selected-seat-title font-title font-uppercase font-blue font-small\">Selected Seats</div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                                <!-- <div class=\"booking-section\" data-section=\"5\">\r\n                  <div class=\"container mobile-only-break-768\">\r\n                    <div class=\"booking-section-content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Checkout</div>\r\n\r\n                      <button class=\"button button-blue booking-next-step t\" data-action=\"6\">Checkout</button>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div> -->\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"template-bottom-inner\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-mobile\">\r\n\r\n\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"template-left\">\r\n\r\n                                      <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>Riverside Studios are delighted to bring to you our next<strong> </strong><i><strong>DOCTOR WHO</strong> </i>episode showcase! Riverside was crucial to the early filming of <i>DOCTOR WHO</i> in its 'classic era', and this celebratory showcase focuses on another of the Doctor's inimitable enemies - The Cybermen - with a complete second Doctor (Patrick Troughton) serial being shown: <strong>TOMB OF THE CYBERMEN</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Doctor Who</i> writers and episode lineup curators Gavin Rymill and James Goss will introduce each Cyber episode, providing a brief watcher's guide, then offer up a quick \"post-show post-mortem\" before introducing the next episode, with a <strong>final Q&amp;A </strong>after the last episode in the showcase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>EPISODE LINEUP</strong></p><p>The Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 1 - 1967-09-02</p><p>The Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 2 - 1967-09-09</p><p>The Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 3 - 1967-09-16</p><p>The Tomb of the Cybermen Episode 4 - 1967-09-23</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Gavin Rymill</strong> is a writer, researcher and digital creator who has worked on the <i>Doctor Who</i> range for nearly 20 years. He sculpted 70 monsters for the figurine collection, illustrated the TARDIS and Dalek manuals and built sets and props for <i>The Evil of the Daleks</i> animation. In his spare time he reconstructs missing episodes and counts the screws on Daleks with Jon Green. His favourite flavour of Dalek is Exxilon.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>James Goss</strong> has written a number of <i>Doctor Who</i> books, produces audio dramas. He once wrote a collection of <i>Doctor Who </i>poetry with Russell T Davies and wrote a book with Tom Baker. His most treasured possession is a copy of <i>The Dalek Book </i>from 1965.</p></div>            \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"template-right\">\r\n              \r\n                        <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Rating Information: </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\"><span>PG</span></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n                                          <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Run time:</div>\r\n                <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>140 mins</span></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Year of release:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>1967</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Company:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>BBC</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              \r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Cast:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>Patrick Troughton</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n              \r\n              <div class=\"performance_details\">\r\n                <div class=\"performance-label\">Select a time to book</div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Saturday 8 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"RwKRlfFw||1111:15385\">13:00</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n      <section class=\" blocks\" id=\"main\" role=\"main\"><section class=\"block block-combi-grid\">\n\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"block-header has-button\">\n            <h3 class=\"block-title font-medium font-title font-uppercase font-blue\">Upcoming Cinema</h3>\n                          <a class=\"button button-blue\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/\">See all</a>\n                      </div>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n          \n<div class=\"grid-item event\">\n  <div class=\"slot event\">\n    \n          <div class=\"slot-image\">\n        <a href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/the-moon-150492/\">\n          <div class=\"image image-container\"><img src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/blank.png\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/b42389fc2d85275a04bfba6f10704587.jpg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;50.8&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;39.4&quot;,&quot;cx&quot;:&quot;926&quot;,&quot;cy&quot;:&quot;281&quot;,&quot;cw&quot;:&quot;3725&quot;,&quot;ch&quot;:&quot;3719&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;6000&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;4000&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  alt=\"\"/></div>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n        <div class=\"slot-content\">\n      <!-- <div class=\"slot-content-inner\"> -->\n\n\n      <div class=\"slot-top\">\n                    <div class=\"slot-date tag date font-uppercase font-tag-small font-blue\"> 04 Mar 2025</div>\n        \n      </div>\n                <h4 class=\"slot-title font-small font-uppercase font-