            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 12425,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 9]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 9]><!-->\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<!--[if !IE]><!--><script>if(document.documentMode) document.documentElement.className+=' ie'+document.documentMode;</script><!--<![endif]-->\n\n<head>\n\n            <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n          })\n                              (window, document, 'script', 'dataLayer', 'GTM-W5VLL9M');\n                  </script>\n    \n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\">\n<title>Memories of Murder\r\n | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"To mark the highly-anticipated release of his next English-language release MICKEY 17, starring Robert Pattinson, Riverside studios dedicate our March classic and silver screen slots to the earlier work of the inimitable, Best Picture-winner (Parasite) di\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Memories of Murder\r\n | Riverside Studios\">\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Memories of Murder\",\"description\":\"To mark the highly-anticipated release of his next English-language release MICKEY 17, starring Robert Pattinson, Riverside studios dedicate our March classic and silver screen slots to the earlier work of the inimitable, Best Picture-winner (Parasite) director BONG JOON-HO.&nbsp;MEMORIES OF MURDERFrom triple Academy Award-winning director, Bong Joon ho (Parasite, Okja, Snowpiercer) comes MEMORIES OF MURDER. Inspired by true events, this rain-drenched sophomore feature from Bong blends true-crime with social satire and comedy in his typically masterful fashion.In 1986 Gyeonggi Province, South Korea, after two women are found raped and murdered, Seoul detective Seo Tae-yoon (Kim Sang-kyung) is brought in to help local detective Park Doo-man (Song Kang-ho, star of Parasite) with the investigation. As more bodies are found, the pair realise they have a serial killer on their hands.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c3a276f2dc7aaba67be44e0b45d9a52.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-03-08T20:20:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-10T12:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon.ico?1651755466\" />\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/memories-of-murder-162592/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//code.jquery.com/ui/1.12.1/themes/base/jquery-ui.css\">\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.css\" /> -->\n\n<link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/css/styles.min.css?v=b660f5e1efcf1b00290891e9f653159e\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<script>\n  document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/, 'js');\n  var base_url = 'https://riversidestudios.co.uk/',\n    gdrck = '6LffRNoZAAAAAJIWWC7QG27lobOmUg6S4sE9GI8k',\n  gdmaps = {},\n    $ajaxRequestSent = false;\n</script>\n\n    <script>\n      var gdEvents = false;\n    </script>\n    \n\n            <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Memories of Murder - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/memories-of-murder-162592/\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/6c3a276f2dc7aaba67be44e0b45d9a52.jpg\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"To mark the highly-anticipated release of his next English-language release MICKEY 17, starring Robert Pattinson, Riverside studios dedicate our March classic and silver screen slots to the earlier work of the inimitable, Best Picture-winner (Parasite) di\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"EN_GB\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Memories of Murder - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"To mark the highly-anticipated release of his next English-language release 