v class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Select a date and time to book time</div> -->\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"booking-section ticket-section-seats\" data-section=\"2\">\r\n                  <div class=\"container mobile-only-break-768\">\r\n                    <div class=\"booking-section-content\">\r\n\r\n                      <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Select your seats</div>\r\n                      <button class=\"button button-blue go-to-basket\" data-action=\"5\" disabled>Next: Checkout</button>\r\n\r\n                      <div class=\"booking-section-field\">\r\n                        <div id=\"priceBands\">\r\n                          <div class=\"price-band\" data-band=\"5\"><span class=\"icon\" style=\"background: #000000\"></span><span class=\"title\">Sold &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"selectedArea\">\r\n                          <div class=\"zoom-label\">Viewing: <span class=\"zoomed-area\"></span></div>\r\n                          <div class=\"reset-zoom\">Reset</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"seatSelector\" style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 70%; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; \">\r\n                          <svg style=\"position: absolute; left:0; top:0; width:100%; height:100%\" id=\"seatingPlan\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"screen\">STAGE</div>\r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"selectedSeats\">\r\n                          <div class=\"selected-seat-title font-title font-uppercase font-blue font-small\">Selected Seats</div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                                <!-- <div class=\"booking-section\" data-section=\"5\">\r\n                  <div class=\"container mobile-only-break-768\">\r\n                    <div class=\"booking-section-content\">\r\n                      <div class=\"section-title font-blue font-uppercase font-small  font-title\">Checkout</div>\r\n\r\n                      <button class=\"button button-blue booking-next-step t\" data-action=\"6\">Checkout</button>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div> -->\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"template-bottom-inner\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-mobile\">\r\n\r\n\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"template-left\">\r\n\r\n                                      <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>To mark the highly-anticipated release of his next English-language release <strong>MICKEY 17</strong>, starring Robert Pattinson, Riverside studios dedicate our March classic and silver screen slots to the earlier work of the inimitable, Best Picture-winner (<i>Parasite</i>) director<strong> BONG JOON-HO</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>MEMORIES OF MURDER</strong></p><p>From triple Academy Award-winning director, Bong Joon ho (<i>Parasite</i>, <i>Okja</i>, <i>Snowpiercer</i>) comes <strong>MEMORIES OF MURDER</strong>. Inspired by true events, this rain-drenched sophomore feature from Bong blends true-crime with social satire and comedy in his typically masterful fashion.</p><p>In 1986 Gyeonggi Province, South Korea, after two women are found raped and murdered, Seoul detective Seo Tae-yoon (Kim Sang-kyung) is brought in to help local detective Park Doo-man (Song Kang-ho, star of <i>Parasite</i>) with the investigation. As more bodies are found, the pair realise they have a serial killer on their hands.</p></div>            \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"template-right\">\r\n              \r\n                        <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Rating Information: </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\"><span>strong gory images, references to sexual violence, language, sex references</span></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n                                          <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Run time:</div>\r\n                <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>131 mins</span></div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Year of release:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>2003</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Company:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>Curzon</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Director:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>Bong Joon-Ho</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n                              <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                  <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Cast:</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"event-info-text\"><span>Roe-ha Kim, Jae-ho Song, Kang-ho Song, Sang-kyung Kim, Hee-Bong Byun</span></div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n              \r\n              \r\n              \r\n              <div class=\"performance_details\">\r\n                <div class=\"performance-label\">Select a time to book</div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Saturday 8 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"L63pg16c||1111:15711\">20:20</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Sunday 9 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"8JWWL7R5||1111:15712\">13:00</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"\" data-tooltip_theme=\"\"></div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"performance-day\">\r\n                  <div class=\"performance-date\">Monday 10 March 2025</div>\r\n                  <div class=\"performance\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button button-blue book_performance_button\" data-id=\"Q9JmJsPY||1111:15713\">12:00</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip_text=\"Our special screenings during quieter times of the day, where we show a selection of new, talk-of-the-town releases and timeless classics. The price includes a complimentary hot drink and biscuits, served before the film.\" data-tooltip_theme=\"Silver-Screen\">Silver Screen</div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n      <section class=\" blocks\" id=\"main\" role=\"main\"><section class=\"block block-combi-grid\">\n\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"block-header has-button\">\n            <h3 class=\"block-title font-medium font-title font-uppercase font-blue\">Bong Joon-Ho: Director Showcase</h3>\n                      </div>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n          \n<div class=\"grid-item event\">\n  <div class=\"slot event\">\n    \n          <div class=\"slot-image\">\n        <a href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/snowpiercer-162601/\">\n          <div class=\"image image-container\"><img src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/blank.png\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/2fa6883f141cc80b2652ee2e02b926f1.jpg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;62.6&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;40.6&quot;,&quot;cx&quot;:&quot;421&quot;,&quot;cy&quot;:&quot;4&quot;,&quot;cw&quot;:&quot;717&quot;,&quot;ch&quot;:&quot;716&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;1280&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;720&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  alt=\"\"/></div>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n        <div class=\"slot-content\">\n      <!-- <div class=\"slot-content-inner\"> -->\n\n\n      <div class=\"slot-top\">\n                    <div class=\"slot-date tag date font-uppercase font-tag-small font-blue\"> 15 - 17 Mar 2025</div>\n        \n      </div>\n                <h4 class=\"slot-title font-small font-uppercase font-title font-blue\">\n            <a href=\