            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 13977,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 9]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 9]><!-->\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<!--[if !IE]><!--><script>if(document.documentMode) document.documentElement.className+=' ie'+document.documentMode;</script><!--<![endif]-->\n\n<head>\n\n            <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n          })\n                              (window, document, 'script', 'dataLayer', 'GTM-W5VLL9M');\n                  </script>\n    \n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\">\n<title>Pitchblack Mixtapes: Jon Hopkins 'Late Night Tales' (10th anniversary)\r\n | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Pitchblack Mixtapes x Late Night Tales: Jon Hopkins (10th Anniversary)&nbsp;*Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted and refunds will not be offered*&nbsp;Come on a trip through Jon Hopkins' record collection at Pitchblack Pla\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Pitchblack Mixtapes: Jon Hopkins 'Late Night Tales' (10th anniversary)\r\n | Riverside Studios\">\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Pitchblack Mixtapes: Jon Hopkins 'Late Night Tales' (10th anniversary)\",\"description\":\"Pitchblack Mixtapes x Late Night Tales: Jon Hopkins (10th Anniversary)&nbsp;*Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted and refunds will not be offered*&nbsp;Come on a trip through Jon Hopkins' record collection at Pitchblack Playback's album listening session in the dark, celebrating 10 years of his supremely dreamy Late Night Tales compilation. Hear this immense mixtape played loud in uncompressed audio on our powerful Screen One cinema sound sound system. No distractions; just you and the music.&nbsp;Late Night Tales welcomed UK producer and musician Jon Hopkins to its fold in 2015 with a beautiful sequence of songs and music. This is Jon Hopkins\\u2019 world, not so much joining the dots as coloring the whole damn picture in.&nbsp;Poet and fellow Brian Eno collaborator (their joint album 'Drums Between The Bells' was released by Warp in 2011) Rick Holland narrates the exclusive spoken word closer 'I Remember', underpinned with additional sound design by Hopkins.&nbsp;\\\"Putting this album together was a unique opportunity for me to present music that I have been listening to for years, free from the constraints of a club setting or trying to stick to one genre. I chose tracks not just because they have been important to me but because of how they sit together, putting as much thought into the transitions and overall narrative as I did into the track choices. I mixed by key and by texture more than anything else, using original sound design, pivot notes, and often recording new synth or piano parts to link things together in a way that flows as naturally as possible. I hope you enjoy it\\\" - Jon Hopkins&nbsp;Tracklist:&nbsp;Ben Lukas Boysen - Sleepers Beat ThemeDarkstar - Hold Me DownHoly Other - Yr LoveTeebs - Verbena Tea With Rebekah RaffNils Frahm - MoreSongs Of Green Pheasant - I Am DaylightsJ\\u221a\\u00ccnsi &amp; Alex - Dan\\u221a\\u00c7ell In The SeaEvenings - BabeLetherette - After DawnJon Hopkins - I RememberDavid Holmes - Hey MaggyAlela Diane - Lady DivineFour Tet - Gillie Amma I Love YouSchool Of Seven Bells - ConnjurPeter Broderick - And It's Alright - Nils Frahm RemixHealth - Before Tigers (Gold Panda Remix)Last Days - Missing PhotosBibio - Down To The SoundA Winged Victory For The Sullen - Requiem For The Static King 1Helios - EmancipationRick Holland - I Remember (Exclusive Spoken Word Piece)&nbsp;What they say about Pitchblack Playback:&nbsp;\\\"This sounds great\\u201d \\u2014 Rick Rubin\\\"A fabulous idea\\\" \\u2014 Jay Kay, Jamiroquai\\\"The optimal way to experience an album\\\" - Max Richter\\\"I have an out-of-body experience every time I go\\\" \\u2014 Jonny, artist manager&nbsp;Ticket includes Pitchblack Playback eye mask for extra darkness.&nbsp;As recommended by The Guardian, GQ, Time Out, Metro and Newsweek.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/18cb055db52b1e3af44d5e29d73d092d.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-03-11T20:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-11T20:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon.ico?1651755466\" />\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/pitchblack-mixtapes-jon-hopkins-late-night-tales-10th-anniversary-159144/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//code.jquery.com/ui/1.12.1/themes/base/jquery-ui.css\">\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.css\" /> -->\n\n<link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/css/styles.min.css?v=b660f5e1efcf1b00290891e9f653159e\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<script>\n  document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/, 'js');\n  var base_url = 'https://riversidestudios.co.uk/',\n    gdrck = '6LffRNoZAAAAAJIWWC7QG27lobOmUg6S4sE9GI8k',\n  gdmaps = {},\n    $ajaxRequestSent = false;\n</script>\n\n    <script>\n      var gdEvents = false;\n    </script>\n    \n\n            <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Pitchblack Mixtapes: Jon Hopkins 'Late Night Tales' (10th anniversary) - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/pitchblack-mixtapes-jon-hopkins-late-night-tales-10th-anniversary-159144/\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/18cb055db52b1e3af44d5e29d73d092d.jpg\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Pitchblack Mixtapes x Late Night Tales: Jon Hopkins (10th Anniversary)&nbsp;*Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted and refunds will not be offered*&nbsp;Come on a trip through Jon Hopkins' record collection at Pitchblack Pla\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"EN_GB\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\"/>\n                        <meta pr