          "bodySize": 11574,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 11574,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 7]>\n<html lang=\"en\"\n      class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9 lt-ie8\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 8]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10 lt-ie9 lte-ie9\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if IE 9]>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js ie legacy-ie lt-ie10\"> <![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 9]><!-->\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\"> <!--<![endif]-->\n<!--[if !IE]><!--><script>if(document.documentMode) document.documentElement.className+=' ie'+document.documentMode;</script><!--<![endif]-->\n\n<head>\n\n            <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\n                new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\n                j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\n                'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\n          })\n                              (window, document, 'script', 'dataLayer', 'GTM-W5VLL9M');\n                  </script>\n    \n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge,chrome=1\">\n<title>Exhibition On Screen: Dawn Of Impressionism, Paris 1874\r\n | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Impressionists are the most popular group in art history - millions \r\n      flock every year to marvel at their masterpieces. But, to begin with, \r\n      they were scorned, penniless outsiders. 1874 was the year that changed \r\n      everything; the fi\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Exhibition On Screen: Dawn Of Impressionism, Paris 1874\r\n | Riverside Studios\">\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Exhibition On Screen: Dawn Of Impressionism, Paris 1874\",\"description\":\"The Impressionists are the most popular group in art history - millions \\r\\n      flock every year to marvel at their masterpieces. But, to begin with, \\r\\n      they were scorned, penniless outsiders. 1874 was the year that changed \\r\\n      everything; the first Impressionists, &#8220;hungry for independence&#8221;, broke \\r\\n      the mould by holding their own exhibition outside official channels. \\r\\n      Impressionism was born and the art world was changed forever.\\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      What led to that first groundbreaking show 150 years ago? Who were the \\r\\n      maverick personalities that wielded their brushes in such a radical and \\r\\n      provocative way? The spectacular Mus&#233;e d&#8217;Orsay exhibition brings fresh \\r\\n      eyes to this extraordinary tale of passion and rebellion. The story is \\r\\n      told not by historians and curators but in the words of those who \\r\\n      witnessed the dawn of Impressionism: the artists, press and people of \\r\\n      Paris, 1874. See the show that changed everything on the big screen.\\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      \\r\\n    \\r\\n    \\r\\n      Made in close collaboration with the Musee d&#8217;Orsay and National Gallery \\r\\n      of Art, Washington D.C.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/99dd7151d26ea76b1745e24f1e400f5c.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-03-30T13:00:00+01:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-03-30T13:00:00+01:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicons/favicon.ico?1651755466\" />\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/exhibition-on-screen-dawn-of-impressionism-paris-1874-161291/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\"/>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"//code.jquery.com/ui/1.12.1/themes/base/jquery-ui.css\">\n<!-- <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/daterangepicker/daterangepicker.css\" /> -->\n\n<link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/css/styles.min.css?v=b660f5e1efcf1b00290891e9f653159e\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<script>\n  document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className.replace(/\\bno-js\\b/, 'js');\n  var base_url = 'https://riversidestudios.co.uk/',\n    gdrck = '6LffRNoZAAAAAJIWWC7QG27lobOmUg6S4sE9GI8k',\n  gdmaps = {},\n    $ajaxRequestSent = false;\n</script>\n\n    <script>\n      var gdEvents = false;\n    </script>\n    \n\n            <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Exhibition On Screen: Dawn Of Impressionism, Paris 1874 - Riverside Studios\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/see-and-do/exhibition-on-screen-dawn-of-impressionism-paris-1874-161291/\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/99dd7151d26ea76b1745e24f1e400f5c.jpg\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The Impressionists are the most popular group in art history - millions \r\n      flock every year to marvel at their masterpieces. But, to begin with, \r\n      they were scorned, penniless outsiders. 1874 was the year that changed \r\n      everything; the fi\"/>\n                        <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Riverside Studios\"/>